<title>USA: DeBartolo Group cites expansion for Q4 gain.</title>
<headline>DeBartolo Group cites expansion for Q4 gain.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon DeBartolo Group Inc, reporting higher 1996 fourth quarter earnings, cited in part an expansion of its portfolio through a merger last August.</p>
<p>It said the merger expanded its portfolio by 61 properties and sent revenues in the quarter to $262.2 million from $155.4 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>The real estate company's shares were up 1/4 at 30-1/2 in late-morning trade.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
